{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203320","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203320","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1320332001:1":{"text":"聞こえてたぞ！お、お前たち！また子爵様を軽々しく名前で呼びやがって！","source_cn":"我听到了！你，你们！又在直呼子爵先生的姓名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14EC8E0F04F4950D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320332002:1":{"text":"あの方のことは子爵様か、子爵閣下と呼べ！","source_cn":"你们应该称呼他为子爵先生！或者子爵阁下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87467CD634983A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320332003:1":{"text":"……本人が気にしてないのに、なんであなたが怒るんですか？","source_cn":"……他自己都不在意，你为什么非要纠正我们啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22E8DD392C4F6131","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320332004:1":{"text":"ふんっ！ハムスターごときに貴族の誇りは理解できんだろうな！","source_cn":"哼！小小仓鼠，哪里懂得贵族的荣耀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F5B09EFA071395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320332005:1":{"text":"いいか、この子爵という爵位は、唯一無二の誉れなのだ！","source_cn":"先生的子爵之位，可是独一无二的荣誉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x128A79E1A9EB1B99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320332006:1":{"text":"確かにリュボミルさんが生きていた時の年齢を思えば、あの若さで子爵になるのは凄いことですが、さすがに大げさすぎでは？","source_cn":"虽然以柳博米尔生前的年龄来说，他能获得子爵之位确实很厉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3F19E50CC3A29EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320332007:1":{"text":"大げさなものか！お前たちは子爵様が何で爵位を賜ったか知っているか？","source_cn":"一点也不夸张！你们知道先生为什么会获得子爵之位吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DC9576D2068F272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320332008:1":{"text":"それは、芸術での功績を認められたからだ！","source_cn":"——是因为先生在艺术方面的成就！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF0B68BCF504996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320332009:1":{"text":"戦績も勲功もない、ただその類い希なき芸術の造詣で爵位を賜ることがどれほど誇らしいことか分かるか！？","source_cn":"没有战绩，没有功勋，仅仅是因为先生高超的艺术造诣！你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AFA157427F01C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320332010:1":{"text":"ブライト王国中どこを探しても、子爵様のような名誉を手にした者はいない！子爵様は、皆に崇められて然るべきお方なのだ！","source_cn":"即使是在整个耀光帝国，也只有先生获得过这般荣誉！所以每...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D95FD342C3928F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docume